\emph{The abstract extremiser.} For $N=4$ and budget $A=1$, the extremal
profile is $(1,\tfrac34,\tfrac12,\tfrac14,0)$, all gaps $\tfrac14$, energy
$4\cdot\tfrac1{16} = \tfrac14 = A^2/N$. The front-loaded profile $(1,0,0,0,0)$
